# Configuration Reference

This page summarizes frequently-used runtime configuration knobs across Loom surfaces.

## CLI environment variables

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LOOM_SERVER_URL` | Default server URL for CLI commands. |
| `LOOM_LLM_PROVIDER` | Default provider selection for CLI runtime. |
| `LOOM_WORKSPACE_ROOT` | Default workspace root for tool operations. |
| `LOOM_LOG_LEVEL` / `LOOM_LOG_FORMAT` | CLI logging behavior. |
| `LOOM_DEFAULT_PROVIDER` | Provider default in config loader. |
| `LOOM_OPENAI_API_KEY` / `LOOM_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Direct provider credentials for compatible flows. |
| `LOOM_OPENAI_MODEL` / `LOOM_ANTHROPIC_MODEL` | Model override values. |
| `LOOM_THREAD_SYNC_URL` | Optional explicit thread-sync endpoint override. |
| `LOOM_AUTO_COMMIT_DISABLE` | Disable auto-commit integration in CLI sessions. |

## Server environment variables

### Core runtime

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LOOM_SERVER_HOST` / `LOOM_SERVER_PORT` | HTTP bind address and port. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_BASE_URL` | Canonical externally-visible server URL. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_DATABASE_URL` | Database connection string. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_ENV` | Environment mode (`development`, `production`, etc.). |
| `LOOM_SERVER_AUTH_DEV_MODE` | Dev auto-auth toggle (must be off in production). |
| `LOOM_SERVER_SIGNUPS_DISABLED` | Disable self-signup flows. |

### OAuth providers

| Prefix | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LOOM_SERVER_GITHUB_*` | GitHub OAuth setup. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_GOOGLE_*` | Google OAuth setup. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_OKTA_*` | Okta OAuth setup. |

### LLM + search

| Variable family | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LOOM_SERVER_OPENAI_*`, `LOOM_SERVER_ANTHROPIC_*`, `LOOM_SERVER_VERTEX_*` | Provider credentials and model defaults. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_GOOGLE_CSE_*`, `LOOM_SERVER_SERPER_API_KEY` | Web search integrations. |

### Platform subsystems

| Variable family | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `LOOM_SERVER_WEAVER_*` | Weaver provisioning behavior. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_SCIM_*` | SCIM enablement and org binding. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_SMTP_*` | Outbound email settings. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_AUDIT_*` | Audit logging and sink behavior. |
| `LOOM_SERVER_WHATSAPP_*` | WhatsApp client defaults. |

## VS Code extension settings

| Setting | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `loom.loomPath` | Path to loom executable. |
| `loom.serverUrl` | Remote server URL. |
| `loom.additionalArgs` | Extra args passed to loom process. |
| `loom.logLevel` | Extension log verbosity. |
| `loom.autoStart` | Auto-start behavior on activation. |

